# Browser tools

Do **not** use browser tools (cursor-ide-browser MCP: navigate, snapshot, screenshot, click, lock, CDP, etc.) unless the user explicitly tells you to.

- Do not open or inspect pages “to verify” UI changes on your own.
- Do not take screenshots or run browser automation unless asked.
- If visual verification seems useful, ask first or wait for the user to request it.
